			<div class="elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated">
						<div class="elementor-element elementor-element-34c41ad elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor" data-id="34c41ad" data-element_type="widget" data-e-type="widget" data-widget_type="text-editor.default">
									<p>PRAXIS Technology Escrow provides secure, SOC 2-compliant software and SaaS escrow services to protect source code, cloud applications, and other critical technology assets. Our Automated Escrow™ and Infinite Retention Policy™ ensure deposits are always current and recoverable. Based in the U.S. and serving clients worldwide, we offer flexible, tailored escrow agreements backed by expert support and trusted service.</p>								</div>
